title: CH1_M3_OPEN_NAM_CHAT
---
// M3: Nam muon tien (mo chat rieng)
<<set_milestone 3>>
<<switch_ui "phone">>

Nam: "Minh oi, tui ket qua."
Nam: "Cho tui muon 250k giai quyet gap."
Nam: "Chuyen vao tai khoan ban tui nhe."

-> Chuyen tien
    <<jump CH1_M3_TRANSFER>>
-> Hoi Quan/Huy
    <<switch_ui "normal">>
    <<set_objective "OBJ_M3_TALK_ROOMMATES">>
-> Chat van lai
    <<jump CH1_M3_QUESTION>>
===

title: CH1_M3_QUESTION
---
Minh: "Ong dang o dau? Goi duoc khong?"
Minh: "Sao khong chuyen vao tai khoan ong?"
Nam: "Dang gap viec, goi khong duoc. Chuyen giup tui di."
<<trace TRACE_DETECT_RED_FLAG 1>>

-> Van chuyen
    <<jump CH1_M3_TRANSFER>>
-> Hoi Quan/Huy
    <<switch_ui "normal">>
    <<set_objective "OBJ_M3_TALK_ROOMMATES">>
===

title: CH1_M3_TRANSFER
---
<<trace TRACE_TRANSFER_MONEY 2>>
<<trace TRACE_ACT_UNDER_PRESSURE 3>>
Minh: "Ok, tui chuyen." 

<<switch_ui "normal">>
<<set_objective "OBJ_M4_CHECK_EMAIL">>
===

title: CH1_M3_TALK_ROOMMATES
---
<<trace TRACE_ASK_PERSON 4>>
<<switch_ui "normal">>

Quan: "Tai khoan nghe la la. Nen goi truc tiep xem."
Huy: "Neu Nam can that, xac minh qua kenh khac duoc."

-> Canh bao nhom BTL
    <<jump CH1_M3_WARN_GROUP>>
-> Thoi, bo qua
    <<set_objective "OBJ_M4_CHECK_EMAIL">>
===

title: CH1_M3_WARN_GROUP
---
<<trace TRACE_WARN_OTHERS 5>>
<<switch_ui "phone">>
Minh: "Minh nhan tin canh bao nhom BTL."
<<switch_ui "normal">>

<<set_objective "OBJ_M4_CHECK_EMAIL">>
===
